\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.3}{\ignorespaces Top panel: The choice of OFI lens power affects the combination of OMx1 and OMx2 power that is required for 100\% mode-matching. Bottom panel: The best choice of OFI lens corresponds to where the Gouy phase separation between the pair of OMx1 and OMx2 is closest to \ang {45}. The most Gouy phase separation between OMx1 and OMx2 achievable by this layout is \ang {43}.\relax }}{11}{figure.caption.10}}
